WEBVTT

NOTE whisper small.en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.070
Congratulations on making it this far.

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:07.950
I just want to wrap up and leave you with a few final thoughts.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:13.190
We've been on quite a journey together, but if you've taken the whole specialization,

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:18.310
then you've learned about neural networks and deep learning, how to improve deep neural

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.710
networks, how to structure machine learning projects, convolutional neural networks, and

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.430
then in this most recent course, sequence models.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:31.510
I know you've worked really hard and I also hope you feel very proud of yourself for your

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.630
hard work and for how much you've done.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.270
So I want to leave you one maybe important thought, which is that I think deep learning

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.750
is a superpower.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.590
With deep learning algorithms, you can make a computer see.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:51.910
You can have a computer synthesize novel art or synthesize music.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:56.990
You can have a computer translate from one language to another, maybe have a look at

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:06.030
the radiology image and render a medical diagnosis or build pieces of a car that can drive itself.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:10.870
And if that isn't a superpower, I don't know what it is.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:16.350
And as we wrap up this sequence of courses, as we wrap up this specialization, I hope

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:24.070
that you will find ways to use these ideas to further your career, to pursue your dreams,

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:29.630
but perhaps most important, to do whatever you think is the best work you can do for

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:30.870
humanity.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:37.070
The world today has challenges, but with the power of AI and power of deep learning,

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.390
I think we can make it a much better place.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:45.550
And now that you have this superpower, I hope you will use it to go out there and

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:51.070
make life better for yourself, but also for other people.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:55.710
And of course, I also hope you feel very proud of your accomplishments and the power

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.710
of AI you've come and of all that you've learned.

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:04.910
And when you complete this sequence of courses, you should also share it on social media

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:08.950
like Twitter or Facebook and let your friends know.

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:13.430
And finally, the very last thing I want to say to you is congratulations on finishing

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:14.430
the course.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:19.390
You feel great about your accomplishments, but also I want to thank you very much.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:24.590
I know that you have a busy life, but despite that, spent a lot of time watching these

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:29.950
videos and maybe spent a lot of time also working on the quizzes and the programming

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.150
exercises.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:35.830
I hope you enjoyed it and you got a lot of the process, but I'm also very grateful

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:40.190
for all your time you spent and for all your hard work you put into learning these

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.550
materials.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.230
So thank you very much.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:44.537
Thank you.
